file=Market Intelligence/DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md · s:=Owns external market intelligence. Sizing \· competitors \· temporal signals \· primary research. Feeds `marcus` (strategy) and `scope` (dept leader) synthesises.\n · st:=**Leader: `scope`** (Drucker persona). Others: `rival` \· `trend` \· `research` — universal principles.\n · t:Tree=```\nTeams/Market Intelligence/\n├── README.md \· DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md\n├── scope/    (3 custom + Drucker identity)\n├── rival/    (3 custom)\n├── trend/    (3 custom)\n└── research/ (3 custom)\n```\n\n12 skills \· 0 marketplace (all-custom appropriate for this domain).\n · rr:Routing rules=- scope routes multi-agent asks (market-entry pulls sizing + competitor + trend + research).\n- Every entry-analysis is CONDITIONAL / RECOMMEND / NOT-YET / NOT-ENTER — never absolute.\n- Feeds `marcus` for strategic decision; never decides.\n · e:Escalation=L3 fixed to `Governance/board`. Always-L3:\n- scope: recommend market EXIT \· regulatory blocker \· sizing divergence > 10×\n- rival: competitive acquisition threat \· category disruption\n- trend: market-critical regulatory pipeline \· macro regime change\n- research: consent issue \· PII leak \· fabricated response allegation\n · tb=\| Case \| We do \| They do \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| User research \| route to Product/ux \| Product/ux owns \| · tb=\| Pricing decisions \| surface competitive pricing \| Product/price decides \| · tb=\| Enacted regulation \| trend hands off pre-enactment \| Legal & Compliance/comply owns enacted \| · tb=\| Strategy decisions \| frame + feed \| Executive Office/marcus decides \| · tb=\| Data pipelines \| consume \| Engineering/dana owns \| · l:Logical=All 4 agents have Path-1 book-requirements. `sample_size_computer` (research) overlaps with Shared OS/logical — import, not duplicate.\n · f:Fleet=+4 (58 → 62). All routing rows added.\n